<title>TOGO: SOCCER-TOGO BEAT LIBERIA 4-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TOGO BEAT LIBERIA 4-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LOME 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Togo beat Liberia 4-0 (halftime 0-0) on Sunday in their group six African Nations Cup qualifier in Lome.</p>
<p>Scorers: Salou Tadjo 52 Noutoutsoudjin Kossi 86 Assignon Komla 89 Salou Bachirou 90</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
